{
  "uid": "aerotrace-alerts",
  "title": "AeroTrace - Alerts",
  "tags": [
    "aerotrace",
    "alerts"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Other AeroTrace dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "aerotrace"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this page",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Prometheus evaluates the rules in `observability/prometheus-rules.yml` and sends firing alerts to the **Alertmanager**, which groups and silences them. A rule is *pending* while its condition holds but its waiting time (`for`) has not passed, then *firing*.\n\n* [Alert groups in Grafana](/alerting/groups?alertmanager=Alertmanager) and [silences](/alerting/silences?alertmanager=Alertmanager) - read from the Alertmanager.\n* [Alertmanager](http://localhost:9093) and [Prometheus rules](http://localhost:9090/alerts).\n\nFiring and resolved alerts are emailed to the local test inbox [Mailpit](http://localhost:8025); no real person receives them. See `observability/alertmanager.yml` to use a real mail server."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Firing alerts",
      "description": "Alerts Prometheus is firing now.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pending alerts",
      "description": "Conditions that hold but have not lasted long enough to fire.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"pending\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active in Alertmanager",
      "description": "Alerts the Alertmanager holds and has not silenced or inhibited.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(alertmanager_alerts{state=\"active\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertmanager up",
      "description": "1 when Prometheus can scrape the Alertmanager.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"alertmanager\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "no data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Alerts now (pending and firing)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "No pending or firing alerts"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alerts over time",
      "description": "Empty while nothing is pending or firing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count by (alertname, alertstate) (ALERTS)",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}} ({{alertstate}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 20
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Contract migration step pending",
      "description": "1 while changeset 006 (scan_source NOT NULL) is not applied; JourneyContractStepPending fires after 24 hours at 1.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (service_name) (journey_migration_contract_pending)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 20
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Notifications failed",
      "description": "Failed deliveries per integration; only integrations with failures are drawn. The local receiver emails Mailpit, so a failure here means Mailpit cannot be reached.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (integration) (rate(alertmanager_notifications_failed_total[5m])) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{integration}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 20
          },
          "noValue": "No failed notifications"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
